Redact (redact.tflite, tokenizer.json, labels.json) by Desert Ant Labs: the multilingual
PII token classifier behind Speedwave's host-side NER detector (crates/pii-ner). The
pinned model files are converted at build time into desktop/src-tauri/pii-ner/ and ship
embedded in the Desktop app only; they are never redistributed as standalone artifacts.
Source: https://huggingface.co/desert-ant-labs/redact (tag v0.4.0). License text follows.

